{"props":{"pageProps":{"listing":{"id":"044ce045-f4ba-41f7-ac79-6ed44b0a1cf0","title":"Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon | Superteam Ukraine Track","slug":"colosseum-crypto-worlds-fair-hackathon-superteam-ukraine-track","description":"\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout Superteam Ukraine\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003eSuperteam Ukraine is here to help people in Ukraine find opportunities in the Solana ecosystem. We're all about connecting talent with the right projects and helping them grow. \u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch1 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMission\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003eBuild a project that significantly contributes to the Solana ecosystem, with strong potential for user growth and product-market fit.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e!! For eligibility, you must also submit to the Colosseum Crypto World's Fair Hackathon !!\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHackathon Track Scope\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003eThis track focuses on projects built by teams in Ukraine for the \u003cstrong\u003eCrypto World's Fair\u003c/strong\u003e hackathon. We're looking for projects that aren't just forks of existing ideas but genuinely push the boundaries of what's possible on Solana. Think about real-world problems that Solana can solve, and how your product can bring a fresh wave of users into the ecosystem or deepen engagement for existing ones.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEligibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe Project must be submitted to the Colosseum portal as well as on Superteam Earn.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003eYour project must be eligible as per the\u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/hackathon#faqs\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e official rules of the global hackathon\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003eYou must register for the hackathon on the \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://colosseum.com/arena/hackathon/register\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003eColosseum platform\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e and mark “\u003cstrong\u003eUkraine\u003c/strong\u003e” as your country\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003eYou must attend the \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://luma.com/onlinedemod\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003eOnline\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e or \u003c/span\u003e\u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" class=\"link\" href=\"https://luma.com/demodaykyiv\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003eOffline\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e Demo day\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eJudging Criteria\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEcosystem Impact:\u003c/strong\u003e Does this project meaningfully enhance the Solana ecosystem with real infrastructure, tooling, or value?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProduct-Market Fit on Solana:\u003c/strong\u003e Is there genuine demand for this on Solana, does it solve a problem for Solana users, and does it show early signs of traction or validation?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUser Growth Potential:\u003c/strong\u003e Will this product bring new users into the Solana ecosystem or deepen engagement for those already in crypto?\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2 class=\"heading-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReward Structure\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul class=\"list-node\"\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e🥇 \u003cstrong\u003eFirst Prize: \u003c/strong\u003e4,000 $USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e🥈\u003cstrong\u003e Second Prize: \u003c/strong\u003e2,500 $USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e🥉 \u003cstrong\u003eThird Prize: \u003c/strong\u003e1,500 $USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🎁 Bonus Prize: \u003c/strong\u003e1,000 $USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e🎁 Bonus Prize:\u003c/strong\u003e 1,000 $USDG\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp class=\"text-node\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: hsl(var(--foreground));\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWe reserve the right to announce the side track results at a later date if the number of submitted projects requires additional review time.\u003c/em\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","deadline":"2026-10-13T06:59:00.000Z","commitmentDate":"2026-10-27T20:59:59.999Z","eligibility":[{"type":"text","order":1,"optional":false,"question":"Project Name"},{"type":"text","order":2,"optional":false,"question":"Project Description"},{"type":"link","order":3,"optional":false,"question":"Project Github Link"},{"type":"link","order":4,"optional":true,"question":"Project Website"},{"type":"link","order":5,"optional":true,"question":"Project X Link"},{"type":"link","order":6,"optional":false,"question":"Link to your pitch deck or Loom/video presentation"},{"type":"text","order":7,"optional":false,"q